      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like there's no actual \"relief\" coming. like, people say things get better, but the math doesn't change. the interest rates go up, rent goes up, everything just keeps climbing. even if i work more, it just buys me more time to be exhausted. it's like I'm just a cog in a machine that's designed to grind me down until there's nothing left. there isn't even a way out that doesn't involve more struggle.",
